<urn:atm:triage:finding/AY13-QA-010>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AY13-QA-010" ;
  triage:title "rust-qa-agent QA-002: resolved_doctor_team's new caller_team-over-config precedence step has no isolated regression test" ;
  triage:description "quality-mgr qa-pr1300-r1 (PR #1300, AY.13 doctor team scope). resolved_doctor_team was changed to add a new precedence step (team_override.or_else(caller_team).or_else(config::resolve_team)), i.e. caller_team (ATM_TEAM) now wins over config-file team resolution when no --team/--all-teams flag is given. No unit test isolates this new branch (a query with caller_team set, no team_override, and a config that would otherwise resolve to a different team). Existing tests (client_context_reflects_caller_not_ambient_environment, team_override_is_reflected_in_client_context) verify client_context/environment fields but do not assert DoctorTeamScope selection against a conflicting config-resolved team." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-ay" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
  triage:category "test-coverage" ;
  triage:severity "minor" ;
